cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the papers of the methods you use
  (listed in the README under "Papers this builds on").
type: software
title: "RSI: Recursive Self-Improvement Agent Skills"
abstract: >-
  Eight recursive self-improvement methods (RRSI, GEPA, autoresearch, Meta-Harness, SoL-Pi, Dream-RSI, EvoMap,
  Harness²) rebuilt from their papers as tested code on one guarded propose-measure-keep loop, with a Claude Code skill
  that applies them to a user's own prompts, agent harness or training script.
authors:
  - name: "GaryTang32"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GaryTang32/RSI"
url: "https://github.com/GaryTang32/RSI"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.2"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
keywords:
  - recursive self-improvement
  - prompt optimization
  - agent harness
  - large language models
  - claude code
  - agent skills
